Tabs",[32,1038,1039],{},"Button-Breite, Radius, Rahmen, Abstände und Innenabstand",[32,1041,1042],{},"GIF-Overlay-Deckkraft (normal und Hover)",[24,1044,1046],{"id":1045},"speichern-und-teilen","Speichern und teilen",[29,1048,1049,1055,1061,1067],{},[32,1050,1051,1054],{},[259,1052,1053],{},".css exportieren"," — Theme-Datei sichern oder weitergeben",[32,1056,1057,1060],{},[259,1058,1059],{},"Zu Themes hinzufügen"," — in den Themes-Ordner speichern und anwenden",[32,1062,1063,1066],{},[259,1064,1065],{},".css importieren"," — Preset oder gespeichertes Theme laden",[32,1068,1069,1072],{},[259,1070,1071],{},"Zurücksetzen"," — SoundNinja-Standard wiederherstellen",[14,1074,1075],{},"Beim Schließen mit ungespeicherten Änderungen fragt SoundNinja nach.",[24,1077,1079],{"id":1078},"ohne-vollen-editor","Ohne vollen Editor",[14,1081,690,1082,1084],{},[259,1083,626],{}," kannst du trotzdem:",[29,1086,1087,1090,1096],{},[32,1088,1089],{},"Ein Theme aus der Liste wählen",[32,1091,1092,1093,1010],{},"CSS-Variablen live bearbeiten (",[259,1094,1095],{},"Eigenes CSS",[32,1097,1098],{},"Eine Theme-Datei in den Themes-Ordner importieren",{"title":129,"searchDepth":130,"depth":130,"links":1100},[1101,1102,1103,1104],{"id":993,"depth":130,"text":994},{"id":1027,"depth":130,"text":1028},{"id":1045,"depth":130,"text":1046},{"id":1078,"depth":130,"text":1079},"Farben, Schriften, Buttons und Tabs im Theme Creator gestalten.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":979,"description":1105},"h6Hta3TDDcThnouY3Pk_Omvjq8Eb8knx-HIAvf5YZd8",{"id":1112,"title":1113,"body":1114,"description":1251,"extension":137,"meta":1252,"navigation":139,"order":1253,"path":1254,"seo":1255,"stem":1256,"__hash__":1257},"content_de\u002Frecording-editor.md","Aufnahme-Editor",{"type":7,"value":1115,"toc":1245},[1116,1119,1125,1129,1135,1155,1158,1162,1187,1191,1206,1210,1224,1235],[10,1117,1113],{"id":1118},"aufnahme-editor",[14,1120,1121,1122,1124],{},"Nimm einen Clip in SoundNinja auf, schneide ihn zu und importiere ihn in einen Tab. Öffnen über ",[259,1123,511],{}," in der Player-Leiste.",[24,1126,1128],{"id":1127},"eingang-wählen","Eingang wählen",[14,1130,690,1131,1134],{},[259,1132,1133],{},"Einstellungen → Audio",":",[29,1136,1137,1143,1149],{},[32,1138,1139,1142],{},[259,1140,1141],{},"Eingabegeräte"," — Mikrofon",[32,1144,1145,1148],{},[259,1146,1147],{},"Ausgabegeräte (PC-Audio)"," — Loopback dessen, was der PC spielt",[32,1150,1151,1154],{},[259,1152,1153],{},"Eingangslautstärke"," — Aufnahme-Gain von 0 % bis 200 %",[14,1156,1157],{},"Der Aufnahme-Button nutzt das hier gewählte Gerät.",[24,1159,1161],{"id":1160},"take-bearbeiten","Take bearbeiten",[29,1163,1164,1167,1170,1178,1181,1184],{},[32,1165,1166],{},"Aufnehmen und stoppen",[32,1168,1169],{},"Pegelmesser beobachten",[32,1171,1172,262,1175],{},[259,1173,1174],{},"Normalisieren",[259,1176,1177],{},"Rauschunterdrückung",[32,1179,1180],{},"Ganzen Clip trimmen, auf Auswahl trimmen oder Auswahl löschen",[32,1182,1183],{},"Rückgängig \u002F Wiederholen",[32,1185,1186],{},"Rein- und rauszoomen",[24,1188,1190],{"id":1189},"stagen-und-importieren","Stagen und importieren",[108,1192,1193,1196,1199],{},[32,1194,1195],{},"Auswahl oder ganzen Track zur Staging-Liste hinzufügen.",[32,1197,1198],{},"Die Liste startet leer: aufnehmen, bearbeiten, dann Clip hinzufügen.",[32,1200,1201,262,1203,1205],{},[259,1202,515],{},[259,1204,518],{}," in den aktuellen oder einen gewählten Tab.",[24,1207,1209],{"id":1208},"stem-trennung-optional","Stem-Trennung (optional)",[14,1211,1212,1213,1216,1217,262,1220,1223],{},"Offizielle Windows-, macOS- und Linux-Release-Builds enthalten das ",[259,1214,1215],{},"Stems","-Feature. Der Aufnahme-Editor kann ",[259,1218,1219],{},"Gesang",[259,1221,1222],{},"Musik"," mit BS-RoFormer behalten.",[14,1225,1226,1227,1230,1231,1234],{},"Das Modell ist etwa 158 MB und ",[259,1228,1229],{},"nicht"," im Installer. Download unter ",[259,1232,1233],{},"Einstellungen → Stem-Trennung"," oder über den Erststart-Hinweis. Der Windows-Installer kann den Download beim ersten Start anbieten.",[14,1236,1237,1238,1006,1241,1244],{},"Eigene Source-Builds brauchen extra Flags (",[322,1239,1240],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[322,1242,1243],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":129,"searchDepth":130,"depth":130,"links":1246},[1247,1248,1249,1250],{"id":1127,"depth":130,"text":1128},{"id":1160,"depth":130,"text":1161},{"id":1189,"depth":130,"text":1190},{"id":1208,"depth":130,"text":1209},"Mikrofon oder PC-Audio aufnehmen, den Clip bearbeiten und aufs Board legen.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1113,"description":1251},"recording-editor","mBUN6yUiwk-kNjhsf48NlWEXXhjw6cOuSAkybSa9wi0",{"id":1259,"title":1260,"body":1261,"description":1474,"extension":137,"meta":1475,"navigation":139,"order":1476,"path":1477,"seo":1478,"stem":1479,"__hash__":1480},"content_de\u002Fremote-control.md","Fernsteuerung",{"type":7,"value":1262,"toc":1467},[1263,1266,1269,1273,1303,1306,1309,1344,1348,1368,1371,1375,1407,1411,1417],[10,1264,1260],{"id":1265},"fernsteuerung",[14,1267,1268],{},"SoundNinja kann im lokalen Netz lauschen, damit Bitfocus Companion (oder jeder HTTP\u002FWebSocket-Client) Sounds spielt und stoppt.",[24,1270,1272],{"id":1271},"remote-server-einschalten","Remote-Server einschalten",[108,1274,1275,1281,1287,1293],{},[32,1276,1277,1280],{},[259,1278,1279],{},"Einstellungen → Remote"," öffnen.",[32,1282,1283,1284,414],{},"Remote-Server aktivieren. Standardport ist ",[259,1285,1286],{},"7331",[32,1288,1289,1290,414],{},"Optional: Token setzen. Clients senden ihn als Bearer-Token oder ",[322,1291,1292],{},"?token=",[32,1294,1295,1298,1299,1302],{},[322,1296,1297],{},"http:\u002F\u002FIP:PORT"," kopieren oder die System-IP unter ",[259,1300,1301],{},"Einstellungen → Über"," holen.",[14,1304,1305],{},"Windows kann beim ersten Start eine Firewall-Abfrage zeigen. Zugriff im privaten Netz erlauben.",[24,1307,81],{"id":1308},"bitfocus-companion",[108,1310,1311,1318,1326,1337],{},[32,1312,1313,1317],{